<mxCell id="c446" value="External (CRM.partners, Laravel users — outside this schema)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#12181F;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="72" y="1677" width="700" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c447" value="FK* = references public.users(id) or &quot;CRM&quot;.partners(id), outside this module's schema (Core-to-Core FK allowed per CLAUDE.md §5). stock_ledger is enforced append-only by a real Postgres trigger (BEFORE UPDATE OR DELETE), not just an app-layer convention — the strictest immutability guarantee in this platform's diagram set. stock_balances is a denormalized cache, always rebuildable from stock_ledger alone, never itself the source of truth. quality_status (stock_ledger) and ownership_type/owning_partner_id (stock_valuation_layers) are Advanced-tier (§3S) placeholder columns — nullable/unused until Quality Management and Consignment are built. document_type/document_id on stock_ledger and subject_type/subject_id elsewhere are polymorphic pointers, informational only, never a real FK." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4A5563;align=left;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1726" width="1600" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
